# Local source contract. Azure still requires a separate deployment.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:15014
@templateId = REPLACE_TEMPLATE_ID
@submissionId = REPLACE_SUBMISSION_ID
@applicantId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### FE: get schema and templateVersionId; require onlineReady=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/form-templates/{{templateId}}

### Admin: inspect original paragraphs before configuring mappings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/form-templates/{{templateId}}/docx-structure

### See docs/api-guide.md for upload and online-config bodies.
### Citizen: save JSON draft (use field IDs from the template schema)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"templateId":"{{templateId}}","applicantId":"{{applicantId}}","formData":{"ho_ten":"Nguoi dung thu nghiem"}}

### Reopen draft, including pinned schema and saved formData
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}?applicantId={{applicantId}}

### Replace ALL formData; omitted optional fields are cleared
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicantId":"{{applicantId}}","formData":{"ho_ten":"Nguoi dung thu nghiem","ngay_sinh":"2000-01-02"}}

### Finalize the electronic form, not the whole procedure application
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicantId":"{{applicantId}}"}

### Download generated copy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}/download-docx?applicantId={{applicantId}}

### List own electronic forms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions?applicantId={{applicantId}}&page=1&pageSize=20

# applicantId is not authentication: integrate verified JWT identity before production.
# Removed: officer review APIs, docx-url, citizen multipart Word editing.
